# Model policy (all desks, all branches)

Parent agent: **Composer 2.5** or **Grok 4.6** (non-fast). Protect the **Other Models** pool.

## Never spawn

- `computerUse` (Claude) — use **cursor-ide-browser** MCP or repo tests
- `mediaReview` (Gemini)
- Subagents on Claude, GPT, Gemini, or `*-fast` models

Repo hook `.cursor/hooks/deny-non-composer-subagents.sh` enforces this for cloud agents on this repo.
